y's most unexpected weapons. Featured on NBC\, CBS\, Cirque du Soleil\, Dry
 
 Bar Comedy\, Amazon\, and Hulu\, Armando's comedy has earned millions of v
 
iews online and taken him to stages across the world. With razor-sharp come
 
dy\, music\, and a French-Iranian-American perspective\, Armando doesn't ju
 
st perform stand-up---he puts on a show. Prepare for a night where elegance
 
 meets chaos... and no topic is off-limits. *******************************
 
*********** SCAM ALERT---IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMATION *********************
 
