 iconic pop anthems that will keep you dancing from start to finish. Dress 
 
up as your favorite anime character\, show off your cosplay\, and join a co
 
mmunity that celebrates creativity\, individuality\, and pure fun. Expect d
 
azzling lights\, high-energy vibes\, unforgettable moments\, and a dance fl
 
oor full of fellow anime lovers. Be loud\, be silly\, and most importantly-
 
be yourself! Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/kawaii-rave-katse
 
